<div data-cgap-sector="Agriculture, Grain &amp; Feed" data-cgap-term="farm"></div><p class="lead">Farms and grain operations do not need another generic &quot;Danger Keep Out&quot; sign. They need a sign on the roof manhole that says never walk down grain, one on the sweep auger that says lock it out before you enter the bin, and one at the manure pit that warns about gas before somebody climbs down.</p><p>Every sign below was written for a specific machine or install point on a working farm, elevator or feed mill: bucket elevator boot pits, bin sidewall doors, nurse tanks, TMR mixers and livestock handling equipment. They are 8x12 aluminum, so they hold up on a bin wall or a barn post for years.</p><h2>What to post, and where</h2><div class="il-areas"><div class="il-area"><h3>Bucket elevator and boot pit</h3><p>53 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the casing beside the hinge side of the boot access door.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-elevator-boot-access-door-sign-cgap-c01044-812">Elevator Boot Access Door</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-boot-clean-out-door-latch-sign-cgap-c01179-812">Boot Clean-Out Door Latch</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-head-pulley-bearing-housing-sign-cgap-c01314-812">Head Pulley Bearing Housing</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-head-house-low-duct-sign-cgap-c01449-812">Head House Low Duct</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Manure pit and slurry handling</h3><p>49 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount at eye level at the manure pit riser cover so it is seen before workers reach the hazard.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-manure-pit-riser-cover-sign-cgap-c10134-812">Manure Pit Riser Cover</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pit-riser-cover-hinge-sign-cgap-c10269-812">Pit Riser Cover Hinge</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-slurry-pump-motor-sign-cgap-c10404-812">Slurry Pump Motor</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pump-discharge-hose-sign-cgap-c10539-812">Pump Discharge Hose</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Livestock handling equipment</h3><p>48 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the chute frame beside the head gate.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-squeeze-chute-head-gate-sign-cgap-c17041-812">Squeeze Chute Head Gate</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-squeeze-chute-side-panel-sign-cgap-c17174-812">Squeeze Chute Side Panel</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-chute-latch-handle-sign-cgap-c17307-812">Chute Latch Handle</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-alley-gate-sign-cgap-c17440-812">Alley Gate</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Sweep auger</h3><p>29 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the wheel kit frame near the axle bracket, at eye level facing the worker approaching the sweep auger transport wheels.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-sweep-auger-transport-wheels-sign-cgap-c10133-812">Sweep Auger Transport Wheels</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-sweep-auger-sign-cgap-w17483-812">Sweep Auger</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-sweep-auger-wheel-kit-sign-cgap-c10268-812">Sweep Auger Wheel Kit</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-sweep-auger-center-pivot-sign-cgap-c10403-812">Sweep Auger Center Pivot</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Bin sweep auger</h3><p>14 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the sweep auger storage rack or on the bin door frame.</p><ul><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-sweep-auger-rear-guard-sign-cgap-n11278-812">Sweep Auger Rear Guard</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-sweep-auger-pre-use-inspection-sign-cgap-n11413-812">Sweep Auger Pre-Use Inspection</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-sweep-auger-storage-rack-sign-cgap-n11548-812">Sweep Auger Storage Rack</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-sweep-auger-start-rule-sign-cgap-n12018-812">Sweep Auger Start Rule</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Feed mixer</h3><p>11 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount at eye level on the wall near the mixer discharge door, facing people approaching the mixer discharge area.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-mixer-discharge-area-sign-cgap-c02460-812">Mixer Discharge Area</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-feed-mixer-access-hatch-sign-cgap-i02730-812">Feed Mixer Access Hatch</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-mixer-top-lid-sign-cgap-c02595-812">Mixer Top Lid</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-mixer-discharge-gate-handle-sign-cgap-c02730-812">Mixer Discharge Gate Handle</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Pellet mill</h3><p>9 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount at eye level on the die door of the pellet mill at eye level, facing people approaching the pellet mill die housing.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pellet-mill-die-housing-sign-cgap-c01045-812">Pellet Mill Die Housing</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-pellet-mill-start-up-sign-cgap-n06635-812">Pellet Mill Start-Up</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-feed-pellet-die-roll-gap-sign-cgap-w10077-812">Feed Pellet Die Roll Gap</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-pellet-mill-room-sign-cgap-i05355-812">Pellet Mill Room</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Grain bin sidewall door</h3><p>8 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the bin wall just above the sidewall door opening at head height.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-grain-bin-sidewall-door-sign-cgap-c01178-812">Grain Bin Sidewall Door</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-bin-sidewall-access-door-sign-cgap-n01718-812">Bin Sidewall Access Door</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-grain-bin-sidewall-door-sign-cgap-i01043-812">Grain Bin Sidewall Door</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-grain-bin-sidewall-door-sill-sign-cgap-c01313-812">Grain Bin Sidewall Door Sill</a></li></ul></div></div><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="il-faq"><details><summary>What signs should go on a grain bin?</summary><p>At a minimum, post entry warnings at every roof manhole and sidewall door, a lockout reminder at the unload and sweep auger controls, and a no-walking-down-grain warning where workers enter. Search &quot;grain bin&quot; in the Sign Finder to see every sign by install point.</p></details><details><summary>Will aluminum signs hold up outside on a farm?</summary><p>Yes. Our signs are .065 rust-resistant aluminum with UV-stable print and pre-drilled corners, built for bin walls, fence posts and equipment frames that live outdoors.</p></details><details><summary>Can I get signs for equipment that is not listed?</summary><p>Probably already. Describe the machine in the search box. If nothing fits, request a quote and we will make it.</p></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What signs should go on a grain bin?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "At a minimum, post entry warnings at every roof manhole and sidewall door, a lockout reminder at the unload and sweep auger controls, and a no-walking-down-grain warning where workers enter. Search \"grain bin\" in the Sign Finder to see every sign by install point."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Will aluminum signs hold up outside on a farm?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Our signs are .065 rust-resistant aluminum with UV-stable print and pre-drilled corners, built for bin walls, fence posts and equipment frames that live outdoors."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can I get signs for equipment that is not listed?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Probably already. Describe the machine in the search box. If nothing fits, request a quote and we will make it."}}]}</script>